# edasm-lc.patch -- rewrite EDASM's read-ROM language-card switches to
# read-RAM, so it sees proshim's copied monitor (in LC RAM, console
# redirected to fd) instead of the real ROM.
#
# Apply to the parts that need only this: EDASM.SYSTEM, EDASM.ASM,
# EDASM.SWAP. (EDASM.ED needs this AND five console bytes -- use
# edasm-ed.patch there.)
#
# Contains NO Apple bytes -- only the transform. Run on a maux volume
# holding a REAL EDASM disk's files:
#     bpatch edasm-lc.patch EDASM.SYSTEM
#     bpatch edasm-lc.patch EDASM.ASM
#     bpatch edasm-lc.patch EDASM.SWAP
#
# Commons: learning:01M1XH5NKEKR7VN47ZMZQFKE26 (the read-ROM->read-RAM
# rewrite proshim's monitor-in-RAM needs). Host equivalent:
# scripts/patch_edasm.py.
flip-lc
